      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "CHANGE",
      "role_note": "the real bug",
      "narration_text": "The first real test ran clean — twelve citations parsed, one patent, eleven papers. But the field that was supposed to say this is non-patent literature wasn't checking for empty text. It was checking for missing text. On this table, missing text isn't missing — it's an empty string. Every single citation was passing that check, whether it had a real patent number or not.",
